  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">이글을 보면서 오늘의 제 수업을 반성할겸... 답글을 올립니다.^^</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">생2의 효소 단원을 가르치면서 이런 문장을 던저주었습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">-\"인생은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >B</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">와 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >D </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">사이의 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >C</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >\"</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">라고 장 폴 사르트르는 말했다고 한다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">인생이란 출생</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >(Birth)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">과 죽음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >(Death) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">사이에서 선택</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >(Choice)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">하는 것이라는 의미다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">우리는 지금 이순간에도 선택을 하며 인생을 채워가고 있는 것이다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >.-</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >아이들에게 효소와 선택의 공통점을 적고, 각자 삶에서 자신의 효소를 찾아보라고 했는데</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >질문이 너무 모호했는지 가만히 앉아 있거나 멍하게 있는 학생이 속출해서 </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >얼버무리고 다시 진도를 나갔습니다.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: HYmodern2; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >열린질문이라 어려워하는 건지 질문이 모호했는지 아직 잘 모르겠어요.</span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: HYmodern2; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ></span></span> </p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: HYmodern2; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >아이들과 생명의 신비함?, 경이로움?을 이야기할 때</span></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: HYmodern2; font-size: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" ><span style=\"letter-spacing: -1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" >어떤 방식으로 대화를 나누시는지 궁금합니다~</span></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
